### Get All Employees
GET http://localhost:8080/employees

###

### HQL Query - Find Employees by Department
GET http://localhost:8080/employees/department/IT

###

### HQL Query - Find Employees with Salary Greater Than
GET http://localhost:8080/employees/salary/50000

###

### Native Query - Search Employee Name
GET http://localhost:8080/employees/search/oh